/* SleepControl interface, help and diagnostics. */
"%@ minutes" = "%@ 分鐘";
". Only the last confirmed task status is available. Check the connection to your AI app." = "。僅能取得上次確認的任務狀態，請檢查與 AI 應用程式的連線。";
"1 hour" = "1 小時";
"1 minute" = "1 分鐘";
"A Codex session reported an unknown or unexpected status." = "Codex 工作階段回報未知或非預期的狀態。";
"A hook may be called Unnamed hook. That is normal. Look for the helper filename and marker below in its command to identify the SleepControl hook." = "掛鉤可能顯示為 Unnamed hook，這是正常情況。請在指令中尋找下方的輔助程式檔名和標記，以辨識 SleepControl 掛鉤。";
"A subtask started by the AI, or a command running in the background, has not finished." = "AI 啟動的子任務或背景執行的指令尚未完成。";
"AI sleep protection" = "AI 睡眠保護";
"AI sleep protection error: %@" = "AI 睡眠保護錯誤：%@";
"AI status is being updated. Please try again shortly." = "正在更新 AI 狀態，請稍後再試。";
"After all tasks stop, SleepControl waits about two seconds, then checks the power source, lid position, and switch settings. If the lid is closed and your settings allow sleep, it puts your Mac to sleep. If the lid is open, it restores your usual settings and lets macOS decide when to sleep automatically." = "所有任務停止後，SleepControl 會等待約兩秒，再檢查供電來源、上蓋位置和開關設定。如果上蓋已關閉且設定允許睡眠，就讓 Mac 進入睡眠；如果上蓋開啟，就恢復平常設定，交由 macOS 決定何時自動睡眠。";
"Authorization was cancelled." = "已取消授權。";
"Battery %@%%" = "電池電量 %@%%";
"Charging" = "充電中";
"Check that the hook comes from your user configuration and its command contains the filename and marker above, then trust it. Check all %@ events below, not just SessionStart:" = "確認掛鉤來自你的使用者設定，指令包含上方檔名和標記後，再將其設為信任。請檢查下方全部 %@ 個事件，而不只是 SessionStart：";
"Check whether hooks have been disabled" = "檢查掛鉤是否已停用";
"Checking whether your Mac can sleep…" = "正在檢查 Mac 是否可進入睡眠…";
"Choose a task that runs on this Mac and takes a little time. Watch the status at the bottom of this window. If your usual settings allow sleep, Claude should appear while the task runs. The status should change when the task finishes or pauses for your input. Seeing the configuration in /hooks alone does not confirm that SleepControl is receiving task status." = "選擇一項在這台 Mac 上執行且需要一些時間的任務，觀察此視窗底部的狀態。如果平常設定允許睡眠，執行時應顯示 Claude；任務結束或暫停等待你輸入時，狀態應隨之改變。僅在 /hooks 看到設定，無法確認 SleepControl 已收到任務狀態。";
"Choose a task that runs on this Mac and takes a little time. Watch the status at the bottom of this window. If your usual settings allow sleep, Codex should appear while the task runs. The status should change when the task finishes or pauses for your input." = "選擇一項在這台 Mac 上執行且需要一些時間的任務，觀察此視窗底部的狀態。如果平常設定允許睡眠，執行時應顯示 Codex；任務結束或暫停等待你輸入時，狀態應隨之改變。";
"Claude Code hook documentation ↗" = "Claude Code 掛鉤說明文件 ↗";
"Claude Code setup" = "Claude Code 設定";
"Claude Code usually picks up configuration changes automatically. If the hooks are still missing or tasks are not detected, reopen the local conversation and try again." = "Claude Code 通常會自動套用設定變更。如果仍找不到掛鉤或偵測不到任務，請重新開啟本機對話後再試。";
"Claude returned an unknown task status: %@" = "Claude 回傳未知的任務狀態：%@";
"Close" = "關閉";
"Cloud tasks, tasks running on a remote computer over SSH, regular Claude chats, and Cowork are not guaranteed to be detected." = "不保證能偵測雲端任務、透過 SSH 在遠端電腦執行的任務、一般 Claude 聊天與 Cowork。";
"Codex WebSocket returned an invalid or oversized message." = "Codex WebSocket 回傳無效或過大的訊息。";
"Codex and Claude Code on Mac computers are supported. Tasks in their desktop apps also need to run locally and report their status to SleepControl. Follow the setup steps in the other two tabs, then run a task to check that it is detected." = "支援 Mac 上的 Codex 與 Claude Code。桌面應用程式中的任務也必須在本機執行，並向 SleepControl 回報狀態。請依另外兩個分頁的步驟設定，再執行任務確認能否偵測。";
"Codex closed the local status connection." = "Codex 已關閉本機狀態連線。";
"Codex hook documentation ↗" = "Codex 掛鉤說明文件 ↗";
"Codex setup" = "Codex 設定";
"Codex status method %@ returned an error (%@)." = "Codex 狀態方法 %@ 回傳錯誤（%@）。";
"Codex status method %@ returned no result." = "Codex 狀態方法 %@ 未回傳結果。";
"Command ends with: # %@" = "指令結尾：# %@";
"Copy hook marker" = "拷貝掛鉤標記";
"Desktop app and common questions" = "桌面應用程式與常見問題";
"Desktop app and custom configuration folders" = "桌面應用程式與自訂設定資料夾";
"Display sleep" = "顯示器睡眠";
"Enter /hooks in Claude Code" = "在 Claude Code 輸入 /hooks";
"Enter /hooks in the Codex CLI" = "在 Codex CLI 輸入 /hooks";
"Find the hooks from your user settings, open their command details, and look for the filename and marker below. In Claude Code, /hooks lets you view the configuration. You do not need to trust each hook as you do in Codex." = "尋找來自使用者設定的掛鉤，開啟指令詳細資訊，確認是否包含下方檔名與標記。Claude Code 的 /hooks 可用來檢視設定，不需要像 Codex 一樣逐一信任掛鉤。";
"For Code tasks in the desktop app that use the local Claude Code engine, follow the same steps to check the setup. Regular Claude chats, Cowork, cloud tasks, and remote SSH tasks are not guaranteed to be detected." = "使用本機 Claude Code 引擎的桌面 Code 任務，也請依相同步驟檢查設定。不保證能偵測一般 Claude 聊天、Cowork、雲端任務與遠端 SSH 任務。";
"Fully charged" = "已充飽電";
"Help category" = "說明類別";
"Help with staying awake during AI tasks" = "AI 任務執行時保持喚醒的說明";
"Helper file: %@" = "輔助程式檔案：%@";
"How it works" = "運作方式";
"If task status cannot be read for a while, SleepControl does not assume the tasks have finished. Any sleep protection already in place is kept until the connection recovers or you turn the AI switch off." = "如果暫時無法讀取任務狀態，SleepControl 不會假定任務已結束。先前已啟用的睡眠保護會保留，直到連線恢復或你關閉 AI 開關。";
"If the first two switches already keep your Mac awake, the AI switch has nothing extra to do. When both switches are on, the AI switch is hidden. Turn either one off to show it again; your previous choice is kept." = "如果前兩個開關已讓電腦保持喚醒，AI 開關就不需額外保護。兩者都開啟時，AI 開關會隱藏；關閉其中一個就會再次顯示，並保留你先前的選擇。";
"If the hooks are missing from /hooks, quit Codex completely and reopen it, then check again. Entering /clear does not mean the hook configuration has been reloaded." = "如果 /hooks 找不到掛鉤，請完全結束 Codex 後重新開啟，再次檢查。輸入 /clear 不代表已重新載入掛鉤設定。";
"If you changed CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, make sure SleepControl and Claude Code use the same configuration directory. If “status unknown” appears after updating Claude Code, check that the hooks are still present and enabled. SleepControl may also need an update to support the new version." = "如果變更了 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR，請確認 SleepControl 與 Claude Code 使用相同的設定目錄。如果更新 Claude Code 後出現「狀態未知」，請檢查掛鉤是否仍存在且已啟用。SleepControl 可能也需要更新以支援新版本。";
"If you changed CODEX_HOME, make sure SleepControl and Codex use the same configuration directory. Conversations that are not connected to the local Codex service may not reliably distinguish running tasks from requests for your approval." = "如果變更了 CODEX_HOME，請確認 SleepControl 與 Codex 使用相同的設定目錄。未連接本機 Codex 服務的對話，可能無法可靠區分執行中的任務與等待你批准的請求。";
"If you have several conversations open, all their tasks need to stop first. Your Mac stays awake while any background task is still running, even if a conversation is waiting for you." = "如果同時開啟多個對話，必須等所有任務都停止。只要仍有背景任務執行，即使某個對話正在等待你，Mac 仍會保持喚醒。";
"If your configuration includes disableAllHooks, make sure it is not true. Setting it to true disables all hooks, so SleepControl cannot receive task status. Set it to false or leave it unset to allow hooks. Project settings, administrator settings, and launch options can also disable hooks." = "如果設定中有 disableAllHooks，請確認未設為 true。設為 true 會停用所有掛鉤，SleepControl 就無法接收任務狀態。設為 false 或不設定此項即可允許掛鉤。專案設定、管理員設定與啟動選項也可能停用掛鉤。";
"In the desktop app, choose a project or Worktree task that runs on this computer and uses the same user configuration. Run a task to check that SleepControl recognizes both active work and pauses for your input." = "在桌面應用程式中，選擇在這台電腦上執行且使用相同使用者設定的專案或 Worktree 任務。執行任務，確認 SleepControl 能辨識執行中及暫停等待你輸入的狀態。";
"Keeping your Mac awake · %@" = "Mac 保持喚醒中 · %@";
