"SleepControl adds the hooks needed to receive task status to ~/.claude/settings.json. Your other settings are kept, so there is no need to add these hooks yourself." = "SleepControl 會將接收任務狀態所需的掛鉤加入 ~/.claude/settings.json。其他設定會保留，不需自行加入這些掛鉤。";
"SleepControl could not restore your sleep settings and has not quit: %@" = "SleepControl 無法恢復睡眠設定，尚未結束：%@";
"SleepControl installs its helper and adds the hooks needed to receive task status to ~/.codex/hooks.json. Your other settings are kept, so you do not need to edit the file yourself. The first time you change power settings, you may need to enter an administrator password." = "SleepControl 會安裝輔助程式，並將接收任務狀態所需的掛鉤加入 ~/.codex/hooks.json。其他設定會保留，不需自行編輯檔案。首次變更電源設定時，可能需要輸入管理員密碼。";
"SleepControl is already running in another process." = "SleepControl 已在另一個行程中執行。";
