"Use ↑ / ↓ to select an event such as SessionStart or UserPromptSubmit, press Return, then open the hook’s command details. The list shows event names, so there will not be an event called SleepControl." = "用 ↑ / ↓ 選取 SessionStart、UserPromptSubmit 等事件，按 Return 進入，再開啟掛鉤的指令詳細資訊。清單顯示的是事件名稱，因此不會有名為 SleepControl 的事件。";
"Waiting for you · Using your usual sleep settings" = "等待你的操作 · 使用平常的睡眠設定";
"Warning separator" = "；";
"What counts as a running task?" = "哪些情況算任務仍在執行？";
"What does this switch do?" = "這個開關有什麼作用？";
"What happens when tasks stop?" = "任務停止後會如何處理？";
"What if the AI is waiting for you?" = "AI 停下來等你操作時如何處理？";
"When the AI pauses for you to type, choose an option, or approve an action, it no longer keeps your Mac awake. An idle conversation does not keep it awake either." = "AI 暫停等待你輸入、選擇或批准操作時，不會繼續使 Mac 保持喚醒。沒有任務的閒置對話也是如此。";
"When this is on, your Mac stays awake while AI tasks are running. Once they stop, the first two switches in the panel determine whether your Mac can sleep." = "開啟後，只要 AI 還在執行任務，電腦就會暫時保持喚醒。任務結束後，再依面板前兩個開關的設定決定是否進入睡眠。";
"Which AI apps are supported?" = "支援哪些 AI 應用程式？";
